ned}\n$$\n\nwhere $\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi )$ and $ϕ\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ].$\n\nTherefore, the third component of $f$ is $\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ.$" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372814 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372815 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372816 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372817 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372818 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1041 "selection" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1104 #edb/ref 17592186372814 13194139535890 true] [17592186372813 1110 #uuid "d195ddf4-74ba-5cc6-ac50-e5851f570c91" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372814 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372814 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535890 true] [17592186372814 1111 #uuid "fc8e2196-cd2d-5356-bf77-09c2b8be9228" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372815 1034 "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372815 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535890 true] [17592186372815 1111 #uuid "a56189f9-f1a3-5391-bd91-16e1e6f643ac" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372816 1034 "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372816 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535890 true] [17592186372816 1111 #uuid "82f3a81b-4486-5a7e-81a2-81f336324494" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372817 1034 "5\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535890 true] [17592186372817 1111 #uuid "7325b847-a70b-5af1-a0f5-a981b3f7f805" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372818 1034 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372818 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535890 true] [17592186372818 1111 #uuid "268b91a5-ed38-54af-a3c2-39060e86eba7" 13194139535890 true] [17592186372819 1017 #edb/ref 1